{"3899400": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Parcel Frenzy: Get To Work!", "steam_appid": 3899400, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [3906450], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⚠️ <strong>IMPORTANT: </strong>This is a chaotic and stressful management game.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Its NOT a cozy or relaxing experience. It’s the WORST job ever, can you survive it?!</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your boss just left for vacation. He's calling from a beach chair.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're surrounded by packages, screaming machines, and a budget that's bleeding money.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Parcel Frenzy.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>📦 THE JOB</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sort packages by weight. Stack pallets under 60kg. Label. Seal. Ship. Repeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sounds simple? It's not.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wrong sort?</strong> Fined.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Machine explodes?</strong> Your problem.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Go bankrupt?</strong> You're in trouble!.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your shift runs 08:00 to 22:00. The chaos never stops.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>👻 THE HAUNTED SHIFT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a cursed graveyard where past workers demand deliveries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fill ghost orders. Load coffins. and earn reputation in this crazy minigame.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hit 10,000 Rep to enter the <strong>global leaderboard</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🎄 SEASONAL CHAOS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Halloween and Christmas themes with unique decorations and radio music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play during the season to unlock permanently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🌙 NIGHT SHIFT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss asleep. Relaxed radio. Work at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only relaxing mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>⚡ SPEED SORTING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boxes fly. Boss screams LEFT, MIDDLE, RIGHT.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab. Throw. Don’t miss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Global leaderboards included.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>💀 CAN YOU KEEP THE COMPANY ALIVE?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or will you join the ghosts?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⭐ WISHLIST NOW ON STEAM ⭐</h2>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⚠️ <strong>IMPORTANT: </strong>This is a chaotic and stressful management game.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Its NOT a cozy or relaxing experience. It’s the WORST job ever, can you survive it?!</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your boss just left for vacation. He's calling from a beach chair.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're surrounded by packages, screaming machines, and a budget that's bleeding money.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Parcel Frenzy.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>📦 THE JOB</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sort packages by weight. Stack pallets under 60kg. Label. Seal. Ship. Repeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sounds simple? It's not.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wrong sort?</strong> Fined.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Machine explodes?</strong> Your problem.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Go bankrupt?</strong> You're in trouble!.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your shift runs 08:00 to 22:00. The chaos never stops.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>👻 THE HAUNTED SHIFT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a cursed graveyard where past workers demand deliveries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fill ghost orders. Load coffins. and earn reputation in this crazy minigame.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hit 10,000 Rep to enter the <strong>global leaderboard</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🎄 SEASONAL CHAOS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Halloween and Christmas themes with unique decorations and radio music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play during the season to unlock permanently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🌙 NIGHT SHIFT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss asleep. Relaxed radio. Work at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only relaxing mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>⚡ SPEED SORTING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boxes fly. Boss screams LEFT, MIDDLE, RIGHT.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab. Throw. Don’t miss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Global leaderboards included.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>💀 CAN YOU KEEP THE COMPANY ALIVE?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or will you join the ghosts?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⭐ WISHLIST NOW ON STEAM ⭐</h2>", "short_description": "Your boss is sipping cocktails on a beach. You're drowning in packages. Sort by weight. Stack pallets. Dodge fines. Fix exploding machines. One wrong move and the company tanks, and guess who gets blamed? Welcome to corporate hell.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Italian, Portuguese - Brazil<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899400/ee884b863fdf0a84cde8184a9c2eb381ee633de3/header.jpg?t=1